CK #MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/a5u4GHWUhk","userId":2292605966,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/DOWmKELW0AAzSGM?format=jpg&name=orig","https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/DOWmKEOX0AAjqkr?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"sophieyateslu","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":2,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929734478309847040","date":1510500947000,"rawContent":"I spoke at @CBHumanity about how tiring (and impossible) survivors are finding sharing\/reading #MeToo\u00a0stories and how you can help us shoulder that burden. If you want any tips on how to be a good ally, see article by @rey_z or contact me as I\u2019ve bunched together some good stuff. https:\/\/t.co\/4AkMFNoCWD","userId":2292605966,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/DOcUk0xX0AAKxZK?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"sophieyateslu","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":2,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":10,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":10.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"933486246709616640","date":1511395439000,"rawContent":"@metpoliceuk Investigation has been launched by Independent Police Complaints Commission (@IPCCNews). They\u2019re appealing for witnesses - if you saw what happened you can contact 08000294687 or southwarkparkroad@ipcc.gsi.gov.uk #JusticeForTerrell #BlackLivesMatter","userId":2292605966,"media":null,"username":"sophieyateslu","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":3,"sumOfBlueLiv